OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly
OL,6,Fcloudy evening with some showers. Then
OL,7,Fturning drier in the early hours with
OL,8,Fsome clear intervals, just the odd
OL,9,Fshower in the Northwest.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FA dry bright start then cloud
OL,12,Fand showers spreading from the west,
OL,13,Fsome heavy. Brightening up again later.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,16,FShowery on Tuesday with strong
OL,17,Fwesterly winds. Showers dying out on
OL,18,FWednesday with some sunny spells
OL,19,Fdeveloping. Cloudy with rain on
OL,20,FThursday, brighter later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
